Package: WRite
Type: Package
Title: Manipulate Word Documents
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Samuel", "JOBERT", email = "samuel.jobert@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Opens, creates, transforms and saves Word documents (.docx) by
    directly manipulating their XML: bookmark management (deletion, text
    replacement, insertion of formatted text, images, 'flextable' tables or
    another Word document), text replacement throughout the document, templates
    (tags, conditional blocks, repeated blocks, mail merge) and cleaning
    (duplicate bookmark identifiers, merging of runs with identical
    formatting).
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    magrittr,
    tools,
    utils,
    xml2 (>= 1.3.0),
    zip (>= 2.1.0)
Suggests:
    flextable,
    officer,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
URL: https://github.com/samuel-jobert/WRite
